&_nc_oc=AdpnmbMiWb0XsbQZ1xFEOJavljAlQQaDIoKl2j19CfBJ277qArQs519FZh_dL9984K8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyEwSoCtYv5EIv15dJWB7SzkOl57lWWxBdsdmTMEOZqzg&oe=69C7B87E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xGJSc5oMiA4Q7kNvwG9inT8&_nc_oc=Adqrc-KuL-1DVupwSD3054rMa6iQZbvVr0lLIj04qMsQNm7DKN2RcD3ix6OSQjvvIug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwM53-A6l7X1x1vQH-0eVI9H_qOJLvW5qjV7gpMgfUk-A&oe=69C7C97C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6hHUC9Pkpo8Q7kNvwElRIAu&_nc_oc=AdpmDkHAr0drun5ScNIDKA5f04sd_BZ-zcTweyuBjyv235flTlCkyZcw6ew0VLYz9kI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwNpXdG4YCp8lBHK1_sUlclFgcSZ_KnB7dqhP40KQZJ3g&oe=69C7E807"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-J1AmKJnmVYQ7kNvwHIdkmn&_nc_oc=AdpUwjSWEutO4epG-FjLJ_8FNTdXXP3PX4f8Xef0U7iXW0gRw0-IoDUgyoBgvASRxVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyeS1vi3iq_Jm9WqDwpR5bnC3ULyTElQLG3uQ83J5dKdg&oe=69C7D3D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WHHjSROD9jYQ7kNvwEtxA2u&_nc_oc=Adry9NPL7UMHZZ3hDpMZQkMc23x5JSNNfnl91rHz_W5H98pwTReEoFamgQ7zb69EXys&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwsg8VvSZBvnwdfxjcIfdk-UMGmpOMJoc-bFVmq6N8eiA&oe=69C7E064"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.